        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Do I know you?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я вас знаю?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The air! It's so darn thick!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Повітря! Воно таке густе!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hey.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гей.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I can't help you, I'm not from around these parts.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не можу тобі допомогти, я не з цих місць.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I couldn't live in a place such as this. It's so damn contaminated!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я не міг би жити в такому місці. Воно таке прокляте забруднене!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I heard there is some trouble in the mine. Hope nothing that will affect us.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я чув, що в шахті якісь проблеми. Сподіваюся, нічого, що на нас вплине.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There was trouble in the mine recently, as far as I heard.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Нещодавно в шахті були проблеми, наскільки я чув.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I was told about some derailed woman who killed a bunch of guys. This place is getting too spooky for my taste.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені сказали про якусь зійшовшу з рейок жінку, яка вбила купу хлопців. Це місце стає занадто моторошним для мого смаку.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
